{"4158560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "代号: Gabby's adventure", "steam_appid": 4158560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158560/extras/960dbfec2a9780081691ed164e3b4fb9.avif?t=1763422460\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158560/extras_big/960dbfec2a9780081691ed164e3b4fb9.avif?t=1763422460 width=1560 height=860 /></span><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a 3D sandbox adventure game that combines elements of action, puzzle-solving, and platforming.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With abundant  side quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus big load of level design.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story brief:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gabby has always dreamed of becoming a hero. Gabby's parents love her dearly. Though they can be a bit careless at times—leaving many things imperfect while renovating their new home. And they still try their best to give Gabby all the love they can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, Gabby heard the house calling to her in a dream. Due to her parents' carelessness, the house was in pain. However, since her parents are grown-ups and no longer possess the innocence of childhood, they couldn’t hear the house’s cries. Thus, the responsibility of saving the house fell upon little Gabby. With her dream of becoming a hero in her heart, Gabby embarked on a tiny but brave journey to rescue the house.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158560/extras/960dbfec2a9780081691ed164e3b4f